{"4515360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Under Potion Influence", "steam_appid": 4515360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild can't identify some of their potions, so they send them your way. Your job is to learn their effects. Experiment with them, drink them... it doesn't matter how. Just label them correctly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Identify Potions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each potion reacts differently when exposed to heat or other materials. Watch carefully. The reactions will tell you what the potion actually does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure it out, write the correct label and send it back to the Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or Drink Them?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saves everyone time. Of course, if the potion melts your bones or turns your vision inside out, that's not my problem. And definitely not the Guild's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet... People...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody should be wandering down here. If they are, they are weirdos, and they probably have weird requests. I hate weirdos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Friendly Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild says you work for them, which means they keep an eye on your work. They will help you out so you don't do a sloppy job, whether you like it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And no, don't go outside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workshop is the only safe place here. There is nothing for you out there. Especially in the clearly-not-for-you area. Do your job and pay your debt to the Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild can't identify some of their potions, so they send them your way. Your job is to learn their effects. Experiment with them, drink them... it doesn't matter how. Just label them correctly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Identify Potions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each potion reacts differently when exposed to heat or other materials. Watch carefully. The reactions will tell you what the potion actually does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure it out, write the correct label and send it back to the Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/b1a3d277676419761325ec2424a186cf.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or Drink Them?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saves everyone time. Of course, if the potion melts your bones or turns your vision inside out, that's not my problem. And definitely not the Guild's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/3af6ffe4c10a96782946695ec1456cb0.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet... People...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody should be wandering down here. If they are, they are weirdos, and they probably have weird requests. I hate weirdos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/342133bfdf95360a143878300ea22f42.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Friendly Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild says you work for them, which means they keep an eye on your work. They will help you out so you don't do a sloppy job, whether you like it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/fefd3f59a1d727b47259fdba0098f4a4.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And no, don't go outside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workshop is the only safe place here. There is nothing for you out there. Especially in the clearly-not-for-you area. Do your job and pay your debt to the Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.poster.avif?t=1787576447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.webm?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515360/extras/1bd30ef417fe4b8b197ec71833f06694.mp4?t=1787576447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Guild can't identify some of their potions, so they send